        "Content": "Apartment No 6 is on the 2nd floor in Block C of Grenville Court adjacent to the Mercy Hospital, Tyndall National Institute and University College Cork. This city centre location offers all amenities within walking distance. \r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance hall with carpet. The living room has carpet flooring and sliding doors to a balcony, the dining has wood flooring and the kitchen has tiled floor with cream shaker fitted units.\r\nBedroom 1: Double with fitted wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 2: Double with fitted wardrobe.\r\nBathroom: Shower, Toilet, Washbasin. \r\nFloor Area: 63m2\r\n\r\nThis property offers an excellent investment opportunity in a superb location.\r\nNo parking.\r\nVacant possession.\r\nManagement Fee: €1,888 per annum to Choices Management Company\r\n\r\nServices: Mains services, Electric Heating.\r\nBER: C No.119837276"
